{
  "slug": "vulcan",
  "name": "Vulcan",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent and human-friendly CLI for trading Phoenix perpetual futures on Solana.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **18 skills**, **3 agents** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (18): `vulcan` (MUST be loaded before producing any answer about Vulcan, Phoenix DEX, Phoenix perpetuals, Solana perps, the `vulcan` CLI/MCP,…), `vulcan-error-recovery` (Error category routing, tx_failed recovery, and network error handling for Vulcan), `vulcan-execution-modes` (Canonical taxonomy of Vulcan's execution modes (Observe / Paper / Dry-Run / Confirm-Each / Auto-Execute), with explicit instructions…), `vulcan-grid-trading` (Grid trading with layered limit orders across a price range on Phoenix DEX perpetuals), `vulcan-lot-size-calculator` (Convert desired token amounts to base lots — the most common agent mistake), `vulcan-margin-operations` (Deposit, withdraw, transfer collateral, isolated margin, and leverage tier management), `vulcan-market-intel` (Ticker, orderbook, candles, market info, and pre-trade analysis patterns), `vulcan-onboarding` (First interaction and new user setup: health check, paper-first path, wallet creation, registration, first deposit, and verification), and 10 more\n- **Agents** (3): `README`, `strategy-template`, `system`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `vulcan`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vulcan@claude-community` from `Ellipsis-Labs/vulcan-cli`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
